WEBVTT

00:05:27.436 --> 00:05:30.556
Ella would still be here alive today

00:05:30.596 --> 00:05:33.396
if air pollution around our home

00:05:33.396 --> 00:05:36.596
had been within the WHO acceptable limits.

00:05:37.196 --> 00:05:42.476
Air pollution is an invisible
global pandemic.

00:05:42.516 --> 00:05:44.356
It's a silent killer.

00:05:44.876 --> 00:05:47.836
You know what,
unless you clean up the air,

00:05:47.836 --> 00:05:51.276
you will never resolve climate change.

00:05:51.276 --> 00:05:52.476
Do you know why?

00:05:52.476 --> 00:05:54.316
It's linked to global warming,

00:05:54.316 --> 00:05:56.076
acid rain,

00:05:56.116 --> 00:05:58.036
effects on wildlife,

00:05:58.036 --> 00:06:00.636
depletion of the ozone layer.